===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|wüeste}} from {{inh|de|goh|wuostī}}, from {{inh|de|gmw-pro|*wōstī}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|[ˈvyːstə]}}
* {{hyphenation|de|Wü|ste}}
* {{hyphenation|de|Wüs|te}}
